# Component split

No all-in-one page (header+filter+table+form+dialog in one file).

| Signal | Action |
|--------|--------|
| Page > ~150 lines | Extract organism/molecule |
| Repeated block ≥2 | Shared component |
| List+search+table | Prefer `DataListPage` — slots for custom cells |
| Dialog flow | `Mo*Dialog` + composable |

```
pages/ → orchestration only
organisms/ → large sections
molecules/Mo* → field groups, filters
ui/ → shadcn primitives, no business logic
```

Dynamic routes: `pages/{m}/[id]/index.vue` (detail), `.../edit.vue` — not `[id].vue` alone.

No `$apiFetch` in child components · no duplicate list shell when `DataListPage` fits.

With size limits: `portal-code-size.mdc`
